Icons from Tabler Icons — https://tabler.io/icons — by Paweł Kuna, under the MIT
licence in LICENSE beside this file.

Only the ones the panel uses are here, and each has had its metadata comment and
its indentation taken out, since neither travels usefully down a wire. Nothing
else about them was touched: they still stroke with currentColor, which is what
lets an icon take the colour of the text beside it.
